flowchart TD
    U[User research question] --> C[Coordinator]
    C --> P[Planner Agent]
    P --> R[Research Agent]
    R --> D[(Local document corpus / TF-IDF retrieval)]
    D --> R
    R --> A[Analysis Agent]
    A --> V[Reviewer Agent]
    V -->|Pass| W[Writer Agent]
    V -->|Needs revision| A
    W --> Q{Citation validation}
    Q -->|Valid| O[Final sourced report]
    Q -->|Invalid| S[Safe stop]
    C -. retries / failures .-> L[(Append-only JSONL audit log)]
    P -. shared state .-> M[(Research state)]
    R -. shared state .-> M
    A -. shared state .-> M
    V -. shared state .-> M
    W -. shared state .-> M
